@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5081
@apiKey = devkey

### List Compare
GET {{HostAddress}}/compare/list
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Compare (identifier = "key" from the list, URL-encoded)
GET {{HostAddress}}/compare?identifier=
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Assign Compare (groupKey: a group "key", "solo" for a product of its own, or "" for back to automatic)
POST {{HostAddress}}/compare/assign
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "historyKey": "",
    "groupKey": "solo"
}
